{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_4_level_main_04-02_beg",
  "groupId": "main_4",
  "stageId": "main_04-02",
  "title": "雨中漫步",
  "storyCode": "4-2",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4c51909419b23bc0c63c32f4597a094be1ca4fb42e7f2bcc9ee687d99e32e5d0",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三十二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "還，還有兩個敵人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "他們正向東側的建築物逃竄——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "我已經瞄準他們了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "啊——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "正中靶心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "噪音，會不會太大了些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "這廢城區裡爆炸聲不斷，我想，敵人也不會特別在意的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "你通知凱爾希醫生了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "在戰鬥開始前，我就已經通知過凱爾希醫生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "整合運動在這片廢城中，確實有活動的跡象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "現在還在通話中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "我們是不是更加隱蔽地行動會更好一些？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "剛才的整合運動成員，似乎使用了探知型的法術。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "為了不暴露我們的位置，必須先發制人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "至少，不能讓整合運動之間互相聯絡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "呼......終於解決了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "霜葉，去看看情況。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "瞭解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "通訊器，拿一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "潔西卡，現在還不能懈怠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "這種事情......我還是知道的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "好的，好的，不會再說這些啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "凱爾希醫生，聽得見嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "一直在聽。確實不能懈怠——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "潔西卡，你背後可能有敵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "嗚哇！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "怎，怎麼會......背後......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "......噫？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "我能從背後攻擊你，說明你動作太慢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "暫時沒事了，凱爾希醫生。我已經解決了敵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "你的速度確實好快......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "我甚至都沒看清楚你是怎麼摸過去，又那麼快趕回來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "——其實我還沒去偵查。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "紅聯繫我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "龍門內部的潛藏著的整合運動還沒有活動的跡象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "現階段還是不要打草驚蛇為妙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "順便，綜合其它廢城偵察小隊的資訊，藏匿在廢城的整合運動的規模，可能遠比想像中要大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "也就是說，中獎的反而是我們這邊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "作為偵查小隊，還是有一些壓力的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "如果這麼說的話，到現在為止，我們所消滅的，已經是第二支整合運動小隊了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "你能確認我們第一次交火的敵人的身份嗎，潔西卡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "嗯，應該沒錯的。我有好好確認過，再讓你射擊的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "......怪我，光顧著計算彈道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "敵人的數量？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "還不清楚具體數字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "霜葉，你那邊如何了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "怎麼了......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "你們去吧，有問題隨時回饋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "我們......過去她那裡看看吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "發生了什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "......你們沒感受到嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "嗯？怎麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "溫度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "這麼一說......是有點冷......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "溫度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "......的確，和城區外，至少有五度以上的溫差。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "平白無故天氣就變了......怎麼會......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "抬頭看。天氣沒有變。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "......啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "不是天氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "是這裡，來，摸一摸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "......廢墟的牆體？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "是的。這堵牆，在吸收熱量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "......怎麼會？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "吸溫過程，在我們來之前，可能就已經結束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "牆體正在回溫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "只是，為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "是什麼人，留下了這種痕跡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "......在這個地方活動的，就只有整合運動了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "整合運動？他們......怎麼做到的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "感染者......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "我聽別人說過這麼一個傳說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "——一個，關於雪怪的傳說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "......真是......令人討厭的感覺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
